### Health + stats (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8089/healthz

### Service manifest (no auth)
GET http://localhost:8089/

### Index raw text
POST http://localhost:8089/index
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Klaro26",
  "text": "Klaro26 is an open-source, AI-native infrastructure API company.",
  "collection": "web"
}

### Index a URL (fetched + extracted)
POST http://localhost:8089/index
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/article",
  "collection": "web"
}

### Search the index by meaning
POST http://localhost:8089/index/search
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "open source API company",
  "collection": "web",
  "k": 5
}

### Fetch one document (paste the content id)
GET http://localhost:8089/index/PASTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer klaro26_dev_key
